      ],
      "text": "The PDF prints “ad adjuvandam” in the Latin response; it is retained. The English supplies a Septuagesima-to-Easter instruction that is more explicit than the Latin parenthesis. Both are preserved. The page running header says Office of the Dead, but the visible office title is Benedictine Oblates (Alternative Version)."
